# Cease: "Exile up to two target cards from a single graveyard." "Up to two" allows one. Bot1's graveyard holds two Lightning
# Bolts (cast on turns 1 and 3), Bot2's holds two (turns 2 and 4). Bot1 chooses one of its own as the first card; for the second
# card Bot2's Bolt is refused (another graveyard) and Bot1's other Bolt is on offer, which Bot1 declines: exactly one card is
# exiled, the other three Bolts stay where they are. Bot1 is the player: 20 - 3 - 3 = 14, +2 = 16, and draws.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Cease // Desist
Mountain
Swamp
